@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

scale 1.5

map "Physical Block\n(per CSD)" as blocks {
  0 => 0123456789
  1 => 0123456789
  2 => 0123456789
  3 => 0123456789
  4 => 0123456789
  5 => 0123456789
  6 => 0123456789
}

note as N1
  **Host Erase Address Range**
  |<-------- from block 0, position 5 to block 4, position 0 -------->|
  
  **Erase Area**
  |<============ from block 0 start to block 6 end ============>|
  
  **Erase Unit Size**
  Each block represents one SECTOR_SIZE unit
  |<->|<->|<->|<->|<->|<->|<->|
end note
@enduml